      "summary": "The event is a wave of nationwide demonstrations in France that grew from a student-led movement over conditions in secondary schools into broader protests over living costs, inflation and public services. Large peaceful marches on October 17, 2026 were accompanied in some locations by clashes, vandalism and looting, prompting local security measures and a national political response.",
